# Hot reload smoke test (spec 031 T3.7): a data asset swapped for a fixture is rebuilt, sent and applied on the
# script's frame; restore-asset brings the original back the same way. The source tree is unchanged afterwards.
fail-on "] E "
wait 30
swap-asset assets/enemies/goblin.enemy fixtures/goblin_fast.enemy
expect-reload enemies/goblin
wait 10
restore-asset assets/enemies/goblin.enemy
expect-reload enemies/goblin
wait 10
end
